msgid "Experiment workspaces"
msgstr "实验工作区"

msgid ""
"A ``SimulationWorkspace`` represents one independent simulation experiment. Cosima, Revan and "
"Mimrec are sibling directories. One root ``manifest.json`` contains the origin, data groups and "
"independent command execution records."
msgstr ""
"一个 ``SimulationWorkspace`` 表示一个独立模拟实验。Cosima、Revan、Mimrec 目录同级。唯一根 ``manifest.json`` 集中保存 "
"origin、数据组与独立命令执行记录。"

msgid ""
"Directories are created when needed. There are no empty stage directories or per-command "
"manifests. Named analysis groups identify data/configuration context, not one invocation of a "
"native program. Unbound adapters retain automatic attempt-NNN grouping for compatibility. Each "
"invocation retains its own ``execution_id``, command, status, logs, exact inputs and output "
"paths."
msgstr ""
"按需创建目录，不预建空 stage 目录，也不使用每命令 manifest。命名分析组表示数据/配置上下文，不等于一次程序调用。未绑定适配器兼容自动 attempt-NNN 组。每次调用有独立 "
"``execution_id``、命令、状态、日志、精确输入输出。"

msgid "Bind an experiment root to a tool object"
msgstr "将实验根绑定到工具对象"

msgid ""
"``working_space`` means the experiment root, for example ``grb-localization-001/`` above. It "
"never means ``mimrec/``, ``mimrec/selection-a/`` or ``mimrec/selection-a/spectrum/``. "
"``result.workspace_dir`` gives this root; ``result.output_dir`` is a stage or analysis directory "
"and is not the workspace root."
msgstr ""
"``working_space`` 指上述 ``grb-localization-001/`` 实验根，绝不指 ``mimrec/``、``mimrec/selection-a/`` 或 "
"``mimrec/selection-a/spectrum/``。``result.workspace_dir`` 返回实验根，``result.output_dir`` 是 "
"stage/分析目录。"

msgid ""
"Both ``Revan`` and ``Mimrec`` accept ``working_space`` in their constructors. Their main "
"config_file, geometry and baseline native overrides also belong in these named analysis "
"constructors. Per-command native overrides affect only the execution; they do not redefine the "
"saved baseline. See :doc:`revan` and :doc:`mimrec` for fixed-definition and legacy compatibility "
"rules. Subsequent operations can omit it. Per-call results or explicit references can still "
"select an exact execution within the bound workspace. A different root or destination raises "
"``ValueError``; create another tool object for another workspace. Without a constructor binding, "
"per-call inputs work as before. For external ``sim_path``/``tra_path`` entry, the bound root "
"supplies the otherwise required ``output_dir``. ``MEGAlibRuntime`` only configures native process"
" startup; it has no workspace or analysis binding."
msgstr ""
"``Revan`` 与 ``Mimrec`` 构造均可绑定 working_space，以及主 config_file、geometry "
"和基准原生覆盖。方法覆盖只影响本次执行，不重定义基准。固定定义与旧兼容见 :doc:`revan` 和 :doc:`mimrec`。后续可省略根参数，仍可用结果或引用精确选执行。不同根/目标抛出"
" ``ValueError``，应另建对象。未绑定时沿用旧方法输入。外部 sim_path/tra_path 可由绑定根提供必需的 output_dir。MEGAlibRuntime "
"只控制进程启动，不绑定工作区或分析。"

msgid "One Cosima per experiment"
msgstr "每个实验只执行一次 Cosima"

msgid ""
"``Cosima.simulate(output_dir=...)`` also treats its destination as an experiment root. It creates"
" ``cosima/inputs``, ``cosima/logs`` and ``cosima/products``. A second Cosima call is rejected, "
"including after failure. Different inputs, settings, seeds or retries require another workspace. "
"Several native output shards are still products of the same unique simulation origin."
msgstr ""
"``Cosima.simulate(output_dir=...)`` 同样将目标当作实验根，按需创建 cosima/inputs、logs、products。拒绝第二次 Cosima "
"调用，包括失败后的重试。不同输入、参数、seed 或重试都要求新 workspace。多个原生分卷仍属于同一模拟 origin。"

msgid ""
"An external sim/evta file can start at Revan with ``sim_path`` and ``output_dir``. An external "
"TRA can start at Mimrec with ``tra_path`` and ``output_dir``. The root records its real external "
"origin; no synthetic earlier execution is created, and Cosima cannot subsequently be added. "
"Additional external TRA steps preserve an existing primary origin."
msgstr ""
"外部 sim/evta 可用 sim_path 与 output_dir 从 Revan 开始；外部 TRA 可用 tra_path 与 output_dir 从 Mimrec "
"开始。根记录真实外部来源，不伪造此前执行，也不能后来补入 Cosima。额外外部 TRA 步骤保留已有主 origin。"

msgid "Mimrec data groups and configuration reuse"
msgstr "Mimrec 数据组与配置复用"

msgid ""
"Construction binds the primary input and main native configuration without creating files or "
"executing a command. The first execution creates the group and stores its complete definition: "
"exact main input, prepared external components, cfg bytes/resource cwd, geometry and baseline "
"overrides."
msgstr "构造绑定主输入和主原生配置，不创建文件或执行命令。首次执行建立组并保存完整定义：精确主输入、准备好的外部成分、cfg 字节/资源 cwd、geometry 和基准覆盖。"

msgid ""
"Method overrides are recorded per execution and do not become group defaults. For example, "
"TotalEnergy_Min=100 above applies only to extraction. image and spectrum use the baseline "
"settings while consuming the already filtered TRA. A different main configuration or dataset "
"requires a new analysis_id; an individual method override does not. Native cfg bytes remain "
"opaque."
msgstr ""
"方法覆盖逐次记录，不成为组默认。例中的 TotalEnergy_Min=100 仅用于提取；image/spectrum 回到基准，同时消费已筛选 TRA。主配置或数据集不同要求新 "
"analysis_id，单次方法覆盖不要求。原生 cfg 始终 opaque。"

msgid ""
"Opening the same analysis_id restores and validates the saved definition, even when the original "
"cfg was removed. Schema-2 legacy groups without a definition retain their former variant-warning "
"behavior until opened with constructor configuration, which binds their existing defaults. No "
"user files are migrated."
msgstr ""
"重开同一 analysis_id 会恢复并校验定义，即使原 cfg 已删除。无 definition 的旧 schema-2 组保留变体警告，直到通过构造配置绑定现有 "
"defaults。不迁移用户文件。"

msgid "Reopen a named analysis without repeating identifiers:"
msgstr "重开命名分析时无需重复全部定义："

msgid ""
"Input selection first uses the own Mimrec group's unique successful extraction. If none exists, "
"it uses the group's unique successful component combination, otherwise its exact registered "
"primary input. With declared components, call extract_events() directly to select the complete "
"dataset in one native -x. Repeated default component extractions start from the declaration; an "
"explicit previous result re-filters only that TRA and does not add components again. For a new "
"group, the constructor resolves the explicit upstream revan_analysis_id to an exact execution. "
"Multiple candidates raise ambiguity errors; directory contents and mtimes never choose an "
"upstream."
msgstr ""
"默认先选自身 Mimrec 组中唯一成功提取；没有则选唯一成功组合，再没有则用精确登记主输入。声明成分后直接 extract_events()，一次原生 -x "
"筛选全部数据。默认重复提取从声明集开始；显式先前结果只重筛该 TRA，不再加成分。新组将 revan_analysis_id 解析成精确上游执行。多个候选报歧义，绝不按目录内容或 mtime "
"选择。"

msgid ""
"``revan_analysis_id`` names the upstream reconstruction; ``analysis_id`` names the Mimrec group. "
"Omitting the latter defaults it to the former:"
msgstr "``revan_analysis_id`` 表示上游重建，``analysis_id`` 表示 Mimrec 自身组；后者省略则默认与前者相同："

msgid ""
"Both differently named analyses can start from the same Revan result. A supplied parent name must"
" match actual provenance, including when a result is passed explicitly or an existing extraction "
"is reused. A named new Mimrec group entered through a workspace requires the Revan parent name; "
"an explicit result can serve as the exact parent instead. External TRA input needs no invented "
"Revan ID."
msgstr ""
"不同名称的分析可从同一 Revan 结果出发。给定父名必须与真实来源一致，即使显式传结果或复用提取结果也交叉检查。新命名组从 workspace 进入时需要 Revan "
"父名，也可用显式结果精确指定父节点。外部 TRA 无需伪造 Revan ID。"

msgid ""
"Names are local to a workspace and stage, use letters/digits/underscores/hyphens, and start with "
"a letter or digit. Constructors create no files and launch no commands. A runner can be reused "
"with the same names in independent workspaces. Existing numbered groups can be reopened by using "
"their basename as analysis_id; files are not renamed or moved."
msgstr ""
"名称在 workspace 与 stage 内有效，可用字母、数字、下划线、连字符，首字符为字母/数字。构造不创建文件或执行命令。独立 workspace 可复用名称。旧编号组可以目录 "
"basename 作为 analysis_id 重开，不重命名或移动文件。"

msgid ""
"``task`` is distinct: for Mimrec it names an operation's output directory such as ``event-"
"selected`` or ``image-selected``. It does not select the analysis group or identify extracted "
"data. Root manifest operation/status/execution/path records select data, even with arbitrary task"
" names. Multiple successful extractions require input_data=an_exact_result; spectrum no longer "
"accepts working_space. See :doc:`mimrec` for the full selection order, component workflow and "
"migration examples. For Revan it remains a queryable operation label. An execution_id identifies "
"one actual native command; each rerun gets another UUID and independent log number. Output names "
"depend on the requested path, not operation count: spectrum.png and spectrum.root can both keep "
"their names. Only an existing or manifest-reserved path receives a suffix such as "
"spectrum-002.root, then spectrum-003.root. The same filename in another output directory does not"
" conflict. Recorded reservations remain protected even when the corresponding file has been "
"removed. Reusing a named analysis never overwrites earlier products. Config variants produce a "
"warning and preserve the saved baseline."
msgstr ""
"``task`` 与分析身份不同：Mimrec 中它是操作输出目录名，如 event-selected 或 image-selected，不选择分析组，也不标识数据。根 manifest 的 "
"operation/status/execution/path 决定输入，因此任意 task 名均可。多个成功提取要求 input_data=精确结果；spectrum 不再接受 "
"working_space，详见 :doc:`mimrec`。Revan 的 task 是可查询标签。execution_id 标识一条真实命令，重跑产生新 UUID "
"和日志编号。文件名按实际路径冲突编号：spectrum.png 与 spectrum.root 可并存；已存在或预留路径才加 "
"-002、-003，不同目录不冲突。即使文件被删除，记录中的预留仍受保护。复用命名组不覆盖历史；旧配置变体警告且保留基准。"

msgid ""
"Without bound names, Revan calls still allocate numbered groups, and Mimrec results carry group "
"context as before. The method-level attempt selector is a legacy explicit selector; a value "
"conflicting with a bound analysis_id is rejected."
msgstr "未绑定名称时，Revan 继续分配编号组，Mimrec 结果仍携带组上下文。方法 attempt 是旧显式选择器，若与已绑定 analysis_id 冲突则拒绝。"

msgid "Central manifest and lineage"
msgstr "集中 manifest 与来源链路"

msgid ""
"Schema-2 workspace manifests contain ``origin``, ``groups`` and ``executions``. Each execution "
"record keeps its own schema, ID, status, runtime, configuration, operation, group, logs, outputs "
"and upstream references. ``result.manifest_path`` points to the root manifest; use "
"``result.record`` to read that particular execution, or select it through an explicit "
"``ExecutionInput`` with its ID."
msgstr ""
"schema-2 根 manifest 包含 ``origin``、``groups``、``executions``。每条执行保留自身 "
"schema、ID、状态、runtime、配置、operation、group、日志、输出和上游。``result.manifest_path`` 指根文件；用 "
"``result.record`` 读单条，或用带 ID 的 ``ExecutionInput`` 显式选择。"

msgid ""
"Selection succeeds only for one successful candidate. It never guesses by file mtime, directory "
"order or the latest result. Repeated successful commands may require retaining their returned "
"result or constructing an explicit ID reference."
msgstr "仅当成功候选恰好一个时选择成功，不按文件 mtime、目录顺序或最新结果猜测。重复成功命令可能要求保留返回对象，或显式建立 ID 引用。"

msgid ""
"Same-workspace parents are referenced by execution ID without copying manifests. For external "
"parents, only the selected execution record is snapshotted; products stay in place. A selected "
"record's checksum is stable when unrelated executions are added to its workspace. Configuration "
"content is recorded in the manifest by default; optional physical configuration snapshots are "
"reused within a data group. Event products are not scanned or hashed by Revan/Mimrec."
msgstr ""
"同 workspace 父节点仅按 execution ID 引用，不复制 manifest。跨 workspace 只快照选定记录，产物留原位。无关执行追加不会改变该记录校验和。默认配置内容存"
" manifest，可选实体快照在组内复用。Revan/Mimrec 不扫描或 hash 事件产物。"

msgid ""
"Manifest allocation/status changes use short exclusive locks and atomic writes. The lock is "
"released during native execution. Contention raises ``FileExistsError``; an abandoned lock after "
"hard termination requires manual inspection. Failed and interrupted commands remain recorded and "
"are never treated as successful results."
msgstr "manifest 分配与状态更新使用短时互斥锁和原子写入，原生命令运行期间释放锁。锁争用抛出 ``FileExistsError``；硬终止遗留的锁需人工检查。失败与中断记录保留，不作为成功候选。"

msgid "Legacy data"
msgstr "旧数据兼容"

msgid ""
"Old standalone manifests and schema-1 workspace indexes remain readable. Their files are not "
"moved or rewritten automatically. New executions targeting an old workspace raise a clear read-"
"only-layout error: supply a fresh ``output_dir`` and an explicit old result/reference instead. "
"The new manifest then records the existing origin/upstream by reference without rerunning Cosima."
" There is no automatic in-place migration in this release."
msgstr ""
"旧独立 manifest 和 schema-1 workspace 仍可读，不自动移动/改写文件。向旧 workspace 新写执行会报只读布局错误；请用新 output_dir "
"和显式旧结果/引用接续。新 manifest 按引用保留原 origin/上游，无需重跑 Cosima。本版本不自动原地迁移。"

msgid ""
"See :doc:`mimrec` for native operations and :doc:`api/index` for signatures. The full-chain smoke"
" example is ``examples/end_to_end_smoke.py``. Prepared-component composition is available through"
" analyze_components; random-window workflows, study scheduling and graph visualization remain "
"separate future work."
msgstr ""
"原生操作见 :doc:`mimrec`，签名见 :doc:`api/index`。完整链 smoke 示例为 "
"``examples/end_to_end_smoke.py``。analyze_components 提供准备好成分的组合；包内随机窗口流程、study 调度与图可视化仍为后续扩展。"

msgid "Recording for large batches"
msgstr "大批量运行的记录策略"

msgid ""
"The default runtime uses ``archive_inputs=False``. Source/configuration bytes and their hashes "
"are retained inside the existing root manifest, rather than creating additional source/cfg files."
" Native tools still require input filenames; those are temporary for the duration of the command "
"and removed afterwards. Mimrec defaults are restored from the recorded bytes, preserving native "
"content without parsing XML. Binary/non-UTF-8 configurations use lossless base64."
msgstr ""
"runtime 默认 ``archive_inputs=False``，source/cfg 字节及 hash 保存在根 "
"manifest，不额外产生持久文件。原生程序所需输入文件仅在命令运行时临时存在，结束后删除。Mimrec 从记录字节恢复默认配置，不解析 XML；二进制/非 UTF-8 内容无损 base64"
" 保存。"

msgid ""
"Cosima's default ``hash_limit_bytes=0`` records discovered resource paths, sizes and modification"
" times without reading or copying nonempty orientation, geometry or spectrum files. Long shared "
"orientation files stay in their original location. Explicit ``hash_limit_bytes`` requests "
"hashing; copying also requires an archival runtime. External resources must be preserved by the "
"user."
msgstr ""
"Cosima 默认 ``hash_limit_bytes=0``，外部 orientation、geometry、spectrum 非空资源只登记路径、大小和 mtime，不读取或复制。共享大 "
"orientation 保留原位。显式 hash_limit_bytes 请求 hash，复制还要求 archive_inputs。外部资源由用户保存。"

msgid ""
"``archive_inputs=True`` explicitly retains source/configuration snapshots. Setup scripts are "
"always sourced from their original path; compact records keep their path and hash, archival "
"records also retain their text in the manifest. There is no setup.sh backup file. The executable-"
"path handoff and launch.sh bootstrap are created in a temporary directory and removed; actual "
"executable path/hash are stored in the manifest. The bootstrap sources the supplied "
"initialization once per native command and execs the tool. It is not another initialization "
"routine."
msgstr ""
"显式 ``archive_inputs=True`` 保留 source/cfg 实体快照。setup 脚本始终从原路径 source；精简模式记录路径/hash，归档模式另把原文存 "
"manifest，不建立 setup.sh 备份。可执行路径传递与 launch.sh 位于临时目录，结束删除；真实二进制路径/hash 存 manifest。每条命令只 source "
"一次所给脚本，然后 exec 工具，不另写一套初始化。"

msgid "Choose log retention on the execution itself:"
msgstr "日志保留在具体执行处选择："

msgid ""
"MEGAlibRuntime has no logging parameters. Cosima supports ``full`` (default) or ``summary``. "
"Other operations currently preserve full logs; their native summary boundaries have not been "
"defined. These are Python capture options, never native MEGAlib flags or configuration overrides."
msgstr ""
"MEGAlibRuntime 没有日志参数。Cosima 支持 ``full``（默认）与 ``summary``。其他操作目前保留完整日志，尚未定义其原生摘要边界。它们是 Python "
"捕获选项，绝不作为 MEGAlib flag 或 -C。"

msgid ""
"Summary mode continuously drains stdout and discards data before a line starting ``Summary for "
"run``. Starting with that line, every byte is streamed to the log through EOF, including shutdown"
" text. A later summary marker replaces the earlier block. There is no size cap on a summary and "
"no byte-tail retention option. Only a short marker overlap is buffered to recognize a keyword "
"split across pipe reads; the complete summary is never accumulated in memory. The input read "
"block size does not limit the amount of retained content."
msgstr ""
"summary 持续排空 stdout，丢弃行首 ``Summary for run`` 之前内容，从该行到 "
"EOF（包括退出文字）完整流式保存。后出现的标记替换先前摘要。不限制摘要字节数，也没有 tail 接口；只缓冲短标记交叠以识别跨读取块关键词，不把完整摘要累积进内存。读取块大小不限制保留内容。"

msgid ""
"If no marker appears, stdout is absent and ``logs.capture.stdout.summary_missing`` is true. No "
"arbitrary tail is substituted for a summary. Stderr is retained in full in either mode; use full "
"stdout when complete diagnostic output is needed. The wrapper does not change native exit-"
"status/output validation."
msgstr ""
"没有关键词时 stdout 不保留，``logs.capture.stdout.summary_missing`` 为 true，不以任意尾部冒充摘要。两种模式都完整保留 "
"stderr；需完整诊断时用 full stdout。退出状态和产物校验规则不变。"

msgid ""
"Empty logs are removed, including stderr. Their manifest path and corresponding result property "
"are None. Check ``result.stderr_path is not None`` before opening it. Nonempty error diagnostics "
"remain available. Setup/bootstrap/path handoffs do not leave permanent files, even in archival "
"mode. Existing historical files are not deleted or reorganized automatically."
msgstr ""
"空日志（包括 stderr）删除，manifest 路径和结果属性为 None。打开前先检查 ``result.stderr_path is not "
"None``。非空错误保留。即使归档模式也不持久保存 setup/bootstrap/path 临时文件。不自动删除或整理历史文件。"

msgid "Recover a removed failed analysis"
msgstr "恢复已删除的失败分析"

msgid ""
"Analysis definitions live in the root manifest, independently of their folders. Removing a "
"Revan/Mimrec analysis directory does not erase its execution history. If **every recorded "
"execution in that group failed**, and the **entire group directory has been removed**, construct "
"the same analysis_id with corrected settings and execute again. A new analysis name is not "
"required in this case. The library never deletes the directory for you."
msgstr ""
"分析定义位于根 manifest，独立于目录。删除 Revan/Mimrec 组目录不会抹掉历史。只有 **组内所有执行均失败** 且 **整个组目录已被删除**，才允许同一 "
"analysis_id 修正设置并重试，无需换名。本库不会替你删除目录。"

msgid ""
"Construction remains read-only. On the next execution, a short manifest lock rechecks the group "
"state, clears its obsolete current definition/defaults, and recreates inputs/logs/products as "
"needed. The new settings become the baseline. An explicitly supplied main cfg starts a fresh "
"baseline; omitted geometry/native baseline overrides do not inherit the discarded settings. "
"Omitting the main cfg instead restores its recorded bytes and baseline, allowing a retry without "
"the original file. Mimrec also retains its declared primary/component references unless "
"explicitly replaced in the constructor."
msgstr ""
"构造仍只读。下次执行在短锁内重查状态，清除旧 current definition/defaults，按需重建 inputs/logs/products，新设置成为基准。显式主 cfg "
"开始新基准，省略 geometry/基准覆盖不继承被丢弃设置；不传主 cfg 则恢复原字节与基准，可在原文件缺失时重试。Mimrec 省略主输入/成分时也保留原声明，除非显式替换。"

msgid ""
"Old failed execution records remain intact, with their original configuration, geometry and "
"error. A new execution UUID and increasing execution/log numbers identify the retry; reserved "
"output names remain protected. The group records recovery_history with the prior execution IDs "
"and the previous definition (or legacy defaults). This also preserves baselines when preparation "
"failed before a command record could capture its configuration. Deleted physical logs/products "
"cannot be recovered from their path references."
msgstr ""
"旧失败记录及原配置、geometry、错误完整保留。新 UUID 与递增执行/日志编号标识重试，历史输出预留继续保护。recovery_history 记录旧 execution IDs 及 "
"previous definition（旧组为 defaults），即使准备阶段失败也能保留旧基准。引用路径不能恢复已删除的实体日志/产物。"

msgid ""
"An existing directory, any successful execution, or an allocated/running record prevents this "
"baseline reset. Changing a protected definition still requires a new analysis_id. If a successful"
" group's directory was removed, repeating the same recorded definition can recreate its layout "
"and produce a new execution; it does not resurrect deleted historical products. Cosima remains "
